::: columns
::: {.column width="50%"}
$$\text{SE}_{\widehat\beta_1} = \frac{\widehat{\sigma}}{s_X\sqrt{n-1}}$$
:::

::: {.column width="50%"}
$\text{SE}_{\widehat\beta_1}$ is a measure of **variability** of the estimate
$\widehat\beta_1$
:::
